---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Filekrush"
  description="Filekrush privacy policy. Your files are processed in your browser and never uploaded to any server."
  canonical="/privacy"
>
  <section class="max-w-[990px] mx-auto px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold mb-4" style="color: var(--text-primary);">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-[16px] mb-10" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">Last updated: April 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <p>Filekrush processes all files entirely in your browser. Your images, PDFs, and documents are never uploaded to any server. We cannot see, access, or store your files. When you close the tab, your data is gone.</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>Filekrush is a browser-based file utility platform operated at filekrush.com. For any privacy-related questions, contact us at filekrush@gmail.com.</p>

      <h2>What data we collect</h2>

      <h3>Files you process</h3>
      <p>None. All file processing (compression, resizing, conversion, metadata removal, PDF generation, passport photo creation) happens locally in your web browser using JavaScript. No files are transmitted to our servers or any third-party servers. We have no ability to access, view, or store your files.</p>

      <h3>Analytics data</h3>
      <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site. This collects anonymous usage data including pages visited, time spent, browser type, device type, and approximate geographic location. This data is aggregated and cannot identify you personally. Google Analytics may use cookies to track sessions.</p>

      <h3>Advertising data</h3>
      <p>We may display advertisements through Google AdSense or other advertising networks. These services may use cookies and similar technologies to serve ads based on your browsing history. You can opt out of personalized advertising through your Google Ad Settings or by using browser extensions that block tracking.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>Filekrush itself does not set any cookies. However, third-party services we use (Google Analytics, advertising networks) may set cookies. You can control cookie behavior through your browser settings.</p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>We use the following third-party services:</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — for anonymous usage analytics</li>
        <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — for displaying advertisements (when applicable)</li>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — for hosting and content delivery</li>
      </ol>
      <p>Each of these services has its own privacy policy governing how they handle data.</p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>Since we do not collect or store your files, there is nothing to retain or delete. Analytics data is retained according to Google Analytics' standard retention policies.</p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>Filekrush does not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. Our tools are general-purpose file utilities and do not target children.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Since we do not store personal data beyond anonymous analytics, there is typically no personal data to request, modify, or delete. If you have concerns, contact us at filekrush@gmail.com.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about this privacy policy, email filekrush@gmail.com.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
